      "AI agents work continuously, at zero marginal cost per interaction. A business with an AI agent handling inbound enquiries receives and processes every enquiry, at any hour, with the same response quality. The commercial case is straightforward: the leads a business currently misses because they arrive outside working hours, while the phone is busy, or because follow-up falls through the cracks are recovered by a well-configured agent.",
